## Collections & Home Vault (v1)

ArtCloset supports **multiple collections** so one install can organize works by show, year, theme, or status without duplicating records. Artworks and collections are **many-to-many**.

### Collection behaviors

| Action | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| **Create** | Global “+ New” beside the collection switcher (also from artwork form / selection Add to…) |
| **Switch** | Collection switcher on Home; “All collections” shows the full vault |
| **Edit** | Rename or archive the **currently viewed** non-system collection |
| **Archive** | Hides from filters; artworks remain in the vault; restore from Settings |
| **Unsorted** | System catch-all when no collection is selected on save |
| **Selection** | Multi-select → Add to…, Email, Trash, Remove from collection |

### Home & navigation

- **Tabs:** Collection (vault), Profile, Settings
- **Collection card:** Available / Sold / Exhibiting counts for the active collection scope
- **Search:** Debounced SQLite search (title, artist, tag, medium, …)
- **Filters:** Status, dates, artist, genre, tag, medium, material, orientation, size bucket, and more
- **Sort & view:** Updated / added / title / status; grid or list
- **Exhibit:** Exhibit Mode and Exhibit labels from the archive section when works are present

**Status:** Implemented

