## Artwork Catalog (v1)

### Capture & images

- Photograph or pick an image; **Android** supports native freeform crop + rotate
- Images resized (max width 2400px), JPEG-encoded, stored under `…/artcloset/images/<uuid>.jpg`
- SQLite stores URI/metadata, not image bytes
- **Batch upload** of photos is Android-capable; iOS/web paths are capability-gated
- Missing image files are a recoverable UI state, not a crash

### Describe

Typical fields include: title, artist (profile “As me” or another artist), completion year/month, short and full description, medium, material, dimensions (cm/in), orientation, framed, status (Available / Loaned / Exhibited / Sold / Not for sale), price/currency, location, notes, tags, genres, collections.

### Share & present

- **Exhibit Mode** — full-screen presentation of the current archive set
- **Exhibit labels** — printable label layouts
- **Share artwork card** — shareable image card via the OS share sheet
- **Email selection** — compose via the device mail client (no ArtCloset mail server)

**Status:** Implemented (media depth Android-first)

