## Platform Strategy (v1)

ArtCloset is **Android-first** for media tooling. iOS remains in the codebase for a later release but is not the current ship target for capture crop or batch flows.

| Capability | Android | iOS (deferred) | Web |
|------------|---------|----------------|-----|
| Managed images + catalog | Yes | Basic pick/save path | No permanent image vault |
| Native freeform crop + rotate | Yes | Pick only | No |
| Batch photo upload | Yes | Hidden / deferred | No |

Central flags live in `src/platform/capabilities.ts`. Expand iOS media through the same gates rather than branching in screens.

