## Limitations (Transparent)

1. **No cloud sync** — Multi-device use requires manual export/backup unless future sync is added.
2. **No collaborative access** — Single-user, single-device model per install.
3. **Catalog export ≠ full image backup** — JSON export does not include image bytes; complete archive + Drive restore is future work.
4. **Drive backup disabled** — Shown in Settings as setup-required until OAuth clients and restore matrix ship.
5. **iOS media depth deferred** — Freeform crop and batch upload are Android-first.
6. **Web is not a production vault host** — Managed images and native share remain mobile-focused; Expo SQLite on web is constrained.

These limits keep infrastructure cost near zero while serving the personal art-vault use case.

