## Technical Foundation

| Layer | Choice | Rationale |
|-------|--------|-----------|
| Framework | React Native (Expo SDK 57) | Cross-platform delivery, native modules for camera/picker/files |
| Language | TypeScript | Type safety for catalog models and schema evolution |
| Navigation | expo-router | File-based routing and modal flows |
| Database | expo-sqlite | Structured queries, migrations, soft delete |
| Files | expo-file-system | Managed artwork images and exports |
| Capture | expo-camera, expo-image-picker, expo-image-manipulator | Photograph, pick, crop/resize pipeline |
| Share | expo-sharing, expo-mail-composer, expo-print | Cards, email, labels |
| Testing | Jest | Domain/repository utilities as coverage grows |

**Quality bar:** Typecheck clean; doctor clean; device QA for permissions, missing images, offline use, empty vs filtered-empty states, and soft-delete restore.

